                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Beautiful game and a piece of art, made with heart and passion.\r\nWonderful and touching story, presented with great acting, thoughtful and interesting characters, good animations and cutscenes.\r\nEnemy design is interesting, I liked the combat, I never grew tired of watching battle animations of the main characters - I found them of high quality and very entertaining.\r\nThe soundtrack is incredible and consists of a huge amount of great songs which can be freely replayed.\r\nI wish KT came back to creating such wonderful gems.",
